-**Parameters:**
-*   **Focal length of lens:** 200 mm [S1].
-*   **Threshold Energy ($E_{th}$):** 0.004 mJ [S1].
-*   **Distribution Factor ($D$):** 50% [S1].
-*   **Refresh Rate ($f_r$):** 20 Hz [S1].
-*   **Grayscale Mapping:** 0–255 maps to $0$–$2\pi$ phase modulation [S1].
